---
import LeagueSetup from '../../components/LeagueSetup';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Draft" description="Run a snake draft on your league, pick by pick, with the best available players by value under your league's scoring.">
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      Draft <span class="ml-1 align-middle rounded-full border border-accent px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-accent">Coming soon</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm text-muted">
      A full draft room is coming for the next season's drafts. Today it is a snake draft you run by hand: teams pick in
      the League page's order, the order reverses every round, and every pick can be undone.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <LeagueSetup mode="draft" client:only="react" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
